            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Wide variety of sources have been used, over a long period of time. A datapaper for the Research Data Journal for the Humanities and Social Sciences is currently pending, that explains in full detail which sources have been used (and also how the data model was constructed). See also:\nKarel Dibbets (2010) Cinema Context and the genes of film history, New Review of Film and Television Studies, 8:3, 331-342, DOI: 10.1080/17400309.2010.499784"
